{"availability":"available","full":"loginov-rocks/Web-Bluetooth-Terminal","name":"Web-Bluetooth-Terminal","description":"Progressive Web Application for serial communication with your own Bluetooth Low Energy (Smart) devices","category":"Developer tools","language":"C++","stars":266,"forks":80,"created":"2017-09-14T16:02:13Z","updated":"2025-11-16T23:36:21Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://loginov-rocks.github.io/Web-Bluetooth-Terminal/","topics":["arduino","ble","bluetooth","bluetooth-low-energy","bluetooth-smart","communication","iot","physical-web","pwa","serial","terminal"],"demo":"https://loginov-rocks.github.io/Web-Bluetooth-Terminal/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T14:52:05.124Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T14:52:05.124Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T14:52:05.124Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T14:52:05.124Z","stars":266,"forks":80}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Web Bluetooth Terminal is a website that can connect with the remote devices which support Bluetooth Low Energy (also called Bluetooth Smart) and exchange data bidirectionally. It can be installed on your homescreen as an application and work offline.","Killer feature: the application establishes serial communication over BLE that is not provided by the specification, but needed if you want to make your own BLE IoT devices using affordable bluetooth modules.","The application utilises BLE service (0xFFE0) and characteristic (0xFFE1) available in low cost BLE modules based for example on CC2541 chip, such as HM-10, JDY-08, AT-09, CC41-A and other. Also, it bypasses 20 bytes limit specific for GATT characteristics by keeping incoming messages in a buffer and waiting for the end of line characters."],"features":["Accessible via browser — just go to the website and you'll get the full featured application, it is not needed to install anything.","Cross-platform — as long as the app is accessible via browser, you can use it with the desktop or with the smart phone browser.","Installable — if you don't want to remember the website address, you can add it to the homescreen.","Works offline after installation on your homescreen, since it is a Progressive Web Application.","And... it have auto scrolling! Enabled by default, but you can scroll the terminal to the top on more than a half of the terminal window height to disable it. Scroll to the bottom to enable it again. Rocket science!"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/loginov-rocks/Web-Bluetooth-Terminal/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"65571e898eaa89e590e19d2532a70e717f2f0252815952247198f0b1fc9f1b1b","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T14:52:05.274Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T14:52:05.274Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Web Bluetooth Terminal is a website that can connect with the remote devices which support Bluetooth Low Energy (also called Bluetooth Smart) and exchange data bidirectionally. It can be installed on your homescreen as an application and work offline.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/loginov-rocks/Web-Bluetooth-Terminal/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"65571e898eaa89e590e19d2532a70e717f2f0252815952247198f0b1fc9f1b1b","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/loginov-rocks/Web-Bluetooth-Terminal/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T14:52:05.275Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2025-11-16T23:36:21Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/loginov-rocks/Web-Bluetooth-Terminal/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T14:52:05.275Z","hash":"65571e898eaa89e590e19d2532a70e717f2f0252815952247198f0b1fc9f1b1b","originalBytes":10261,"storedBytes":10261,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["module","bluetooth","ble","npm","web","device","run","terminal","browser","own","app","application","connected","devices","gets","install","message","bluetoothterminal","commands","directory","files","how","low","make","need","service","smart","styl